    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114718" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῖσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρίω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>smearing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ ἐλαιου εἰς ἱμάτιον χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					966b35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀγγείων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.58
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῆσιν</span> codd.); [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς κεφαλῆς],</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλειψις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				141
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>anointing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PPetr.
				2p.72
			</span></i>
