				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					2.14.3
				</span></i>
			 (pl.) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>colouring, varnish, wash,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Muson.
				<u>Fr.</u>
