					<u>IG</u>
					42(1).109
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				 i 128
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				4.270
			</span></i> (Panamara, i(?) B.C.).</div>
